arrival.description:
Its `arrival-status.json` (a DAQ's catalog thread, or a follower: its last check, the points read and, while a
point holds it, the waiting reason in `error`; a `notify` run's: the last file it refused for having no number);
null while it has none (a follower before its first, a `notify` run before such a file).

technique.description:
The motor groups the scan moves (``beamline.motor_groups``), in the order of its scan rows: ``line`` (one
sample motor) or ``area`` (more), ``depth``, ``energy``, ``other``, joined with `` + ``, e.g. ``area + depth``;
``none`` without positioners.

get.description:
The run (its source, paths, author and notes), its job's ID and its stored wire parameters (`parameters`,
null without them), read from the database, so a run migrated from v1 has them too;
its paths also relative to the file root that holds them (`relative_paths`). 404 for an unknown run.
